--━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━
-- CORE: RENDER LOOP (Aimbot + FOV + Triggerbot + Silent)
--━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━
local lastAutoShootTime = 0
local trigMonClock = 0

RunService:BindToRenderStep("RivalsDesync", Enum.RenderPriority.Camera.Value - 1, function()
    if not Desync.active then return end
    if not Desync.realCFrame then return end
    if not humanoidRootPart or not humanoidRootPart.Parent then return end
    humanoidRootPart.CFrame = Desync.realCFrame
end)

table.insert(ActiveConnections, RunService.RenderStepped:Connect(function(dt)
    camera = workspace.CurrentCamera
    local center = getScreenCenter()

    if aimbotFOVCircle then
        pcall(function() aimbotFOVCircle.Position=center; aimbotFOVCircle.Radius=CFG.Aimbot.FOV; aimbotFOVCircle.Visible=CFG.Aimbot.ShowFOV and CFG.Aimbot.On end)
    end
    if silentFOVCircle then
        pcall(function() silentFOVCircle.Position=center; silentFOVCircle.Radius=silentGetEffectiveFOV(); silentFOVCircle.Visible=CFG.Silent.ShowFOV and CFG.Silent.On end)
    end

    -- AIMBOT
    if CFG.Aimbot.On and CameraController and isKeyHeld(CFG.Aimbot.Key) then
        local targetPart = getAimbotTarget()
        if targetPart then
            pcall(function()
                local camPos = camera.CFrame.Position
                local aimPos = CFG.Aimbot.ClosestPos and getClosestPointOnPart(targetPart) or targetPart.Position
                local dirUnit = (aimPos - camPos).Unit
                local targetPitch = math.asin(dirUnit.Y)
                local targetYaw   = math.atan2(-dirUnit.X, -dirUnit.Z)
                local baseAlpha = CFG.Aimbot.Smoothness / 100
                local yawAlpha   = baseAlpha * (CFG.Aimbot.XSmooth / 100)
                local pitchAlpha = baseAlpha * (CFG.Aimbot.YSmooth / 100)
                if isAirborne(targetPart.Parent) then
                    local jf = CFG.Aimbot.JumpSmooth / 100
                    yawAlpha = yawAlpha * jf; pitchAlpha = pitchAlpha * jf
                end
                yawAlpha   = math.clamp(yawAlpha, 0, 1)
                pitchAlpha = math.clamp(pitchAlpha, 0, 1)
                local current = CameraController.Rotation
                CameraController:SetRotation(Vector2.new(
                    current.X + (targetPitch - current.X) * pitchAlpha,
                    current.Y + angleDiff(current.Y, targetYaw) * yawAlpha
                ))
            end)
        end
    end

    -- SILENT AIM AUTO-SHOOT
    if CFG.Silent.On and CFG.Silent.AutoShoot and isKeyHeld(CFG.Silent.Key) then
        local now = tick()
        if now - lastAutoShootTime >= 0.1 then
            if silentFindTarget() then lastAutoShootTime = now; pcall(function() mouse1click() end) end
        end
    end

    -- TRIGGERBOT
    trigMonClock = trigMonClock + dt
    if CFG.Trigger.On and isKeyHeld(CFG.Trigger.Key) then
        local target = getTriggerTarget()
        if target then
            if not TriggerState.waiting then TriggerState.waiting=true; TriggerState.delayTimer=CFG.Trigger.Delay/1000 end
            TriggerState.delayTimer = TriggerState.delayTimer - dt
            if TriggerState.delayTimer <= 0 then
                TriggerState.cooldownTimer = TriggerState.cooldownTimer - dt
                if TriggerState.cooldownTimer <= 0 then triggerFire(); TriggerState.cooldownTimer = CFG.Trigger.BurstMs / 1000 end
            end
            if trigMonClock >= 0.1 then
                trigStatusV.Text = TriggerState.delayTimer > 0 and "STATUS: WAITING..." or "STATUS: FIRING"
                trigStatusV.TextColor3 = TriggerState.delayTimer > 0 and C.orange or C.green
                trigDelayV.Text = string.format("DELAY: %.0fms", math.max(0, TriggerState.delayTimer * 1000))
            end
        else
            TriggerState.waiting=false; TriggerState.delayTimer=0; TriggerState.cooldownTimer=0
            if trigMonClock >= 0.1 then trigStatusV.Text="STATUS: SCANNING"; trigStatusV.TextColor3=C.dim; trigDelayV.Text="DELAY: --" end
        end
    else
        TriggerState.waiting=false; TriggerState.delayTimer=0; TriggerState.cooldownTimer=0
        if trigMonClock >= 0.1 then trigStatusV.Text=CFG.Trigger.On and "STATUS: KEY NOT HELD" or "STATUS: IDLE"; trigStatusV.TextColor3=C.dim; trigDelayV.Text="DELAY: --" end
    end
    if trigMonClock >= 0.1 then trigMonClock = 0 end
end))

--━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━
-- CORE: ORBIT + VOIDSPAM DESYNC (Heartbeat)
--━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━
local orbitAngle = 0
local monitorClock = 0

table.insert(ActiveConnections, RunService.Heartbeat:Connect(function(dt)
    -- ORBIT
    if CFG.Orbit.On and not Desync.active and CFG.OrbitTarget then
        local mc=LP.Character; if mc then
            local mr=mc:FindFirstChild("HumanoidRootPart")
            local tc=CFG.OrbitTarget.Character
            if mr and tc then
                local tr=tc:FindFirstChild("HumanoidRootPart")
                local mh=mc:FindFirstChildOfClass("Humanoid")
                if tr and mh and mh.Health>0 then
                    orbitAngle=orbitAngle+(CFG.Orbit.Speed*dt)
                    if orbitAngle>math.pi*2 then orbitAngle=orbitAngle-math.pi*2 end
                    local tp=tr.Position
                    mr.CFrame=CFrame.new(tp+Vector3.new(math.cos(orbitAngle)*CFG.Orbit.Radius,CFG.Orbit.Height,math.sin(orbitAngle)*CFG.Orbit.Radius),tp)
                end
            end
        end
    end

    -- VOIDSPAM DESYNC
    if not Desync.active then return end
    if not humanoidRootPart or not humanoidRootPart.Parent then Desync.active=false; return end
    local hum=character:FindFirstChildOfClass("Humanoid")
    if not hum or hum.Health<=0 then
        if Desync.realCFrame then humanoidRootPart.CFrame=Desync.realCFrame end
        Desync.active=false; Desync.phase="idle"; Desync.currentDepth=0; return
    end
    Desync.realCFrame=humanoidRootPart.CFrame; Desync.phaseTimer=Desync.phaseTimer+dt

    if Desync.phase=="hide" then
        Desync.currentDepth=math.min(Desync.currentDepth+CFG.Void.StepSpeed,CFG.Void.VoidDepth)
        if Desync.phaseTimer>=CFG.Void.HideTime then Desync.phase="attack";Desync.phaseTimer=0;Desync.shotsFired=0;Desync.shotCooldown=0 end
    elseif Desync.phase=="attack" then
        Desync.currentDepth=math.max(Desync.currentDepth-CFG.Void.StepSpeed*3,0)
        Desync.projCheckCD=Desync.projCheckCD+1
        if Desync.projCheckCD>=3 then Desync.projCheckCD=0; Desync.projDetected=checkProjectiles(); if Desync.projDetected then Desync.phase="hide";Desync.phaseTimer=0;Desync.totalCycles=Desync.totalCycles+1 end end
        if Desync.phase=="attack" and Desync.currentDepth<=2 and CFG.Void.AutoFire then
            Desync.shotCooldown=Desync.shotCooldown-dt
            if Desync.shotsFired<CFG.Void.ShootAttempt and Desync.shotCooldown<=0 then autoFire(); Desync.shotsFired=Desync.shotsFired+1; Desync.shotCooldown=0.05 end
        end
        if Desync.phase=="attack" and Desync.phaseTimer>=CFG.Void.AttackTime then Desync.phase="hide";Desync.phaseTimer=0;Desync.totalCycles=Desync.totalCycles+1 end
    end

    if Desync.currentDepth>0 then
        local realPos=Desync.realCFrame.Position; local rotation=Desync.realCFrame-realPos
        humanoidRootPart.CFrame=CFrame.new(Vector3.new(realPos.X,realPos.Y-Desync.currentDepth,realPos.Z))*rotation
    end

    monitorClock=monitorClock+dt
    if monitorClock>=0.15 then
        monitorClock=0
        local pTxt=Desync.phase=="hide" and "HIDING" or Desync.phase=="attack" and "ATTACKING" or "IDLE"
        local pCol=Desync.phase=="hide" and C.cyan or Desync.phase=="attack" and C.orange or C.dim
        monPhaseV.Text="PHASE: "..pTxt; monPhaseV.TextColor3=pCol
        monDepthV.Text=string.format("DEPTH: %.0f / %d",Desync.currentDepth,CFG.Void.VoidDepth)
        monDepthV.TextColor3=Desync.currentDepth>0 and C.green or C.orange
        monShotsV.Text=string.format("SHOTS: %d / %d%s",Desync.shotsFired,CFG.Void.ShootAttempt,CFG.Void.AutoFire and " (auto)" or " (manual)")
        monCycleV.Text="CYCLES: "..Desync.totalCycles
    end
end))

